# v1.0.2 (S10.2): round map nodes, selection pill, plain links; Back
# navigation (title-bar arrow, Esc), on the test notes pack (Forma 1440x1920).
copy-notes tests/test-notes/_test
# Written for the 1.0 layout: run at UI scale 100 % (v1.1 default is 200 %).
ui-scale 100
expect-open _test/test-00-start-here.md
tap-on Graph
expect-graph map
shot v1.0.2-graph-map
tap-on Node:_test/wiki/test-hub.md
expect-selected _test/wiki/test-hub.md
shot v1.0.2-graph-map-pill
tap-on Zoom+
tap-on Zoom+
expect-zoom 2
shot v1.0.2-graph-map-zoomed
tap-on Zoom-
tap-on Zoom-
# Second tap opens in preview and pushes history: Back appears.
tap-on Node:_test/wiki/test-hub.md
expect-mode preview
expect-open _test/wiki/test-hub.md
shot v1.0.2-back-button
# Follow a wiki link in preview, then Back twice.
tap-on Link:test-spoke-1
expect-open _test/wiki/test-spoke-1.md
tap-on Back
expect-open _test/wiki/test-hub.md
expect-mode preview
esc
expect-open _test/test-00-start-here.md
expect-mode write
# Files pushes too.
tap-on Files
tap-on test-todos.md
expect-open _test/test-todos.md
shot v1.0.2-back-write
tap-on Back
expect-open _test/test-00-start-here.md
# Night and landscape map.
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/On
tap-on Orientation/Landscape
tap-on Close
tap-on Graph
tap-on Node:_test/test-todos.md
shot v1.0.2-graph-map-landscape-night
tap-on Close
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/Off
tap-on Orientation/Portrait
tap-on Close
